1
00:00:00,728 --> 00:00:02,438
(Penny:)Oh, I didn't tell you?

2
00:00:02,605 --> 00:00:05,315
(Penny:)You're banished
from the Cheesecake Factory.

3
00:00:06,109 --> 00:00:08,949
(Leonard:)- Why?
- Well, you have three strikes.

4
00:00:09,988 --> 00:00:11,698
(Penny:)One, coming in. Two, sitting down.

5
00:00:11,864 --> 00:00:14,364
(Penny:)And three, I don't like your attitude.

6
00:00:14,659 --> 00:00:18,119
(Sheldon:)You can't do that. Not only is it a violation
of California State Law...

7
00:00:18,288 --> 00:00:21,288
(Sheldon:)...it flies directly in the face
of Cheesecake Factory policy.

8
00:00:21,457 --> 00:00:25,167
Yeah, no, there's a new policy:
No shoes, no shirt, no Sheldon.

9
00:00:26,838 --> 00:00:29,678
(Howard:)I bet we could sell that sign
all over Pasadena.

10
00:00:31,801 --> 00:00:33,801
- Penny, can I talk to you for a minute?
- Uh-huh.

11
00:00:35,346 --> 00:00:37,096
(Penny:)- Hi.
- Hi.

12
00:00:38,308 --> 00:00:39,478
(Leonard:)Look, here's the thing.

13
00:00:39,642 --> 00:00:43,142
(Leonard:)I talked to Sheldon and he feels terrible.

14
00:00:43,313 --> 00:00:46,983
(Leonard:)And he agrees that he was unreasonable
and out of line.

15
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:49,570
- Really? Well, that's great.
- Yeah.

16
00:00:49,736 --> 00:00:51,656
Oh, just apologize to him, okay?

17
00:00:52,447 --> 00:00:54,867
What? I'm not gonna apologize
to that nutcase.

18
00:00:55,033 --> 00:00:58,703
(Leonard:)Come on, it's easy.
He'll even tell you what to say.

19
00:00:59,203 --> 00:01:03,163
Don't you get it? You keep going along
with his insanity, you're encouraging him.

